  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "Slice 2a-2 real-interpreter proof demo: on tick, GetShared<SquadRallyState>(\"rally\") reads the entity-scoped shared slot, a pure FunctionCall increments RallyCount, SetShared<SquadRallyState>(\"rally\", ...) writes it back, then Return(Success). Proves GetShared/SetShared compile to calls into Fdp.Toolkit.Blueprints.Partitioning.BlueprintSharedState (Slice 2a-1) and that repeated ticks accumulate RallyCount through the accessor + StructureHash guard.",
